    "text": "<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi> </mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi> </mi><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>  is zero only at one point<br > <math><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></math>  =    <math><mi> </mi><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>2</mn><mo>]</mo></math>  as it is an odd function,<br > <math><msup><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <br > <math><mi>G</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi> </mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></math>  =  <math><mro